    {
      "bbox": [
        159,
        1233,
        1683,
        1420
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "As you know, the Ford Foundation has made a grant of $250,000 to New York University for a pilot program of Executive Development for the City of New York and the metropolitan region to be conducted in cooperation with the City of New York.",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 21,
          "mean": -0.2926,
          "min": -1.5969
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
          "mean": -0.0001,
          "min": -0.0001
        },
        "text": {
          "n_tokens": 53,
          "mean": -0.0001,
          "min": -0.0046
        }
      },
      "ink": {
        "ink_px": 17131,
        "area_px": 271215,
        "density": 0.06316,
        "chars": 240,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 14.01
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        164,
        1429,
        1687,
        1616
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "I am extremely pleased that the Ford Foundation saw fit to make this grant as it will enable us to develop a program which has the objective of giving City officials in the executive levels the opportunity to improve their management skills.",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 21,
          "mean": -0.2831,
          "min": -1.4617
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
          "mean": -0.0002,
          "min": -0.0002
        },
        "text": {
          "n_tokens": 43,
          "mean": -0.0,
          "min": -0.0006
        }
      },
      "ink": {
        "ink_px": 15699,
        "area_px": 270532,
        "density": 0.05803,
        "chars": 241,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 15.35
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        170,
        1624,
        1731,
        1847
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "To effectuate these aims, I have asked the Personnel Director to contact the Commissioners and Heads of Agencies and to enlist their cooperation in the development of a plan of action for the proposed Executive Program. We plan to convene a series of meetings of Commissioners at which I will participate, wherein we will discuss the proposed Executive Program.",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 21,
          "mean": -0.2911,
          "min": -1.4454
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
          "mean": -0.0001,
          "min": -0.0001
        },
        "text": {
          "n_tokens": 65,
          "mean": -0.0028,
          "min": -0.1768
        }
      },
      "ink": {
        "ink_px": 22473,
        "area_px": 333900,
        "density": 0.0673,
        "chars": 361,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 16.06
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        175,
        1855,
        1731,
        2042
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "As it will be necessary to keep the meetings relatively small, we will not be able to invite all Commissioners to participate at the first conference. If you feel that this program can be of special value to your agency, you may wish to make sure to be included in the program from the outset.",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 21,
          "mean": -0.2578,
          "min": -1.3613
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
          "mean": -0.0,
          "min": -0.0
        },
        "text": {
          "n_tokens": 59,
          "mean": -0.0006,
          "min": -0.0324
        }
      },
      "ink": {
        "ink_px": 16823,
        "area_px": 278992,
        "density": 0.0603,
        "chars": 293,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 17.42
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        179,
        2049,
        1737,
        2273
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "This program has all the promise of becoming one of the outstanding Executive Development Programs in the country and a great credit to our City. It is my hope that it will be possible for all Commissioners to give this important program their active interest and personal support which are essential for its success.",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 21,
          "mean": -0.2825,
          "min": -1.4575
        },
        "category": {
